options.C:
创建一个 SCP，并将其附加到组织根。在 SCP 中加入以下语句：
{
  "Sid": "DenyEC2Creation",
  "Effect": "Deny",
  "Action": ["ec2:RunInstances"],
  "Resource": ["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:instance/*"],
  "Condition": {"Null": {"aws:RequestTag/BusinessUnit": "true"}}
}

options.D:
创建一个 SCP，并将其附加到组织管理账户。在 SCP 中加入以下语句：
{
  "Sid": "DenyEC2Creation",
  "Effect": "Deny",
  "Action": ["ec2:RunInstances"],
  "Resource": ["arn:aws:ec2:*:*:instance/*"],
  "Condition": {"Null": {"aws:RequestTag/BusinessUnit": "false"}}
}
